OK   ComputeFailure = definition (longest proper border + 1) for every pattern
OK   ComputeFailure makes at most 2m character comparisons
OK   recursive definition (base case i = 1, P[0] matches everything) = ComputeFailure
OK   OptimizeFailure(ComputeFailure) = ComputeOptFailure (P[0] matches nothing) = definition of the optimized function
OK   KnuthMorrisPratt with ComputeFailure = brute force on all pairs
